==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# [[communication|Communication]] by a person or an organization with the purpose of creating a favorable [[public image]]; commonly referred to as [[PR]].
#* [[w:Edward Bernays|Edward Bernays]], in the documentary ''The Century of the Self'' (Adam Curtis, 2002):
#*: {{quote|en|''Propaganda'' got to be a bad word because of the Germans using it [in WWI]. So what I did was to try to find some other words. So we found the words ''counsel on '''public relations'''''.}}

